@title Help icons: Hoist run and Hoist in 3D carry no explanation text
@area Simulate
@sizes 1366x768 1920x1080
# The notes of Hoist run, Hoist in 3D and Drive run sit behind the ? of each window; check_text fails on any label of more than 40 words (result sentences and page names still run to 20 to 36 words; the target is 8).
open qa/fixtures/hoist-two-speed.novo
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Hoist run
wait 4
key Enter
wait 30
shot hoist-run
check_text 40
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Hoist in 3D
wait 4
key Enter
wait 30
shot hoist-3d
check_text 40
check_layout
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text Drive run
wait 4
key Enter
wait 30
shot drive-run
check_text 40
check_layout
